  "title": "Grilled Chicken Teriyaki Skewers with Miso Ranch",
  "description": "Chef John brings big flavor to grilled teriyaki chicken skewers by using a tasty marinade and an herb-filled miso ranch dipping sauce to finish.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-05-29T00:40:29-04:00",
